title: 'statement gossip: schedule initial sync only after affinity filter arrived'
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    With the v2 DHT path enabled (`STATEMENT_STORE_V2_DHT_ENABLED=1`), a
    `statement/2` peer receives no statements until its affinity filter
    arrives: peers exchange filters as the first message on connect, and the
    initial sync then replays only the stored statements the peer's filter
    matches. Without the flag, behavior is unchanged.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: minor
